mapping "V6562.1" source="V6562" target="242090001" relationship=source_is_narrower_than_target {
    confidence 0.03 scheme="vocabmod-se-confidence@1"
    comment "en" """
        Source V6562 = Swedish 5th-character extension of ICD-10 V65.6/.7/.9 (occupant of heavy
        transport vehicle injured in collision with railway train, passagerare skadad i trafikolycka,
        activity=förvärvsarbete). The activity-context suffix has no SNOMED CT representation; the base
        ICD-10 V65.6/V65.7/V65.9 maps via Athena crosswalk to SNOMED CT 4054296 (Motor vehicle on road in
        collision with vehicle running on rails) and 444074 (Victim of vehicular AND/OR traffic
        accident). 4054296 captures the specific collision mechanism; 444074 is the broader
        traffic-accident victim concept. Targets are broader: SNOMED CT drops the activity dimension.
        Confidence : verified Athena crosswalk on the base code, one-level broader (activity context
        unrepresented).
        """
}
